     "planLine": "wide — Levin, Julian, Max, Kiaan — the four kick and chase a ball across the Lindenhof under the linden trees, the Grossmünster towers catching afternoon sun in the distance — the four friends and the autumn square are established as the story's world",
     "pageNumber": 1
    },
    {
     "planLine": "over-the-shoulder — Levin, Herr Keller — the man in the orange vest lifts his leaf blower and starts it near the chess field while Levin watches — the roaring leaf blower is now running on the square",
     "pageNumber": 2
    },
    {
     "planLine": "medium — Julian — he kneels in the big leaf heap between the linden roots, both hands pulling a large warm egg up out of the leaves — the warm, softly knocking egg is found",
     "pageNumber": 3
    },
    {
     "planLine": "low-angle — Levin, Julian — Julian holds the egg while Levin looks up into the linden's crown where one golden eye blinks down from the branches — Rubina in her nest is discovered",
     "pageNumber": 4
    },
    {
     "planLine": "wide — Rubina, Levin, Julian, Max, Kiaan — the four children stand below the linden with their backs to the viewer, looking up at Rubina in her nest who calls down to them asking for help — the four are asked for help and the stake is spoken aloud",
     "pageNumber": 5
    },
    {
     "planLine": "over-the-shoulder — Julian, Rubina — Julian looks up at Rubina in the linden crown, where she presses her wings hard over her ears against the blower's roar — the children know Rubina cannot fly down to help them",
     "pageNumber": 6
    },
    {
     "planLine": "medium — Levin, Herr Keller — Levin stands beside Herr Keller whose blower is roaring, Levin's mouth open in a whisper that the machine swallows — the blower roars on and Levin's first chance was wasted",
     "pageNumber": 7
    },
    {
     "planLine": "close-up — Max, Herr Keller — Max cups his hands and shouts into Herr Keller's ear; Herr Keller throws his head back laughing — Herr Keller has been told about the egg and dismissed it; the blower goes back on",
     "pageNumber": 8
    },
    {
     "planLine": "ultra-wide — the egg — the egg wobbles out from the linden roots and rolls down the slope toward the top of the steep stairs, the leaf blanket scattered behind it — the egg is rolling toward the stairs unguarded",
     "pageNumber": 9
    },
    {
     "planLine": "medium — Max — he sprints and plants his foot against the egg, stopping it at the very top step — the egg is stopped at the stairhead; the danger is past",
     "pageNumber": 10
    },
    {
     "planLine": "close-up — Kiaan — he wraps the egg tightly in his autumn jacket, then nearly sets the bundle down before catching himself and clutching it hard against his chest — the egg is wrapped and held; Kiaan's forgetfulness is shown and overcome",
     "pageNumber": 11
    },
    {
     "planLine": "medium — Kiaan, Julian — Julian covers his ears and presses behind Levin as Herr Keller blows right up to the linden, while Kiaan clutches the jacketed egg and watches the knocking almost stop — the knocking has nearly stopped; the sun lights only the tips of the Grossmünster towers; this is the low point",
     "pageNumber": 12
    },
    {
     "planLine": "close-up — Julian — Julian stands with his mouth open and one finger raised as he speaks — Julian has spoken the key observation aloud",
     "pageNumber": 13
