    {
     "planLine": "close-up — Levin, Herr Keller — with shaking knees Levin reaches out and tugs Herr Keller's sleeve — the blower is off and Herr Keller's attention is on Levin",
     "pageNumber": 14
    },
    {
     "planLine": "medium — Levin, Herr Keller — Levin points at the leaf cart by the chess field, asking question after question while Herr Keller stands with his back to the linden — the quiet holds; Herr Keller's back stays turned",
     "pageNumber": 15
    },
    {
     "planLine": "medium — Kiaan, Rubina, Max — Kiaan stretches up, holding the jacketed egg toward Rubina's open branch-claws at the foot of the linden trunk, Max beside him — Rubina has the egg",
